    {
      "text": "Hi Dana, Dev from HyperSale. I noticed Brightpath\u2019s recent sales hiring push\u2014can I take 30 seconds to explain why ramp consistency prompted my call?",
      "llm_ms": 3825,
      "end": false,
      "audio_s": 10.57
    },
    {
      "text": "HyperSale lets new reps practice realistic buyer calls before prospects, while managers see quote-backed progress weekly. How are you keeping ramp quality consistent across hires?",
      "llm_ms": 3123,
      "end": false,
      "audio_s": 11.74
    },
    {
      "text": "That makes sense\u2014Gong is strong after the call; HyperSale adds practice before it. Where are new hires rehearsing before live prospects today?",
      "llm_ms": 3078,
      "end": false,
      "audio_s": 9.26
    },
    {
      "text": "I hear you\u2014this should save manager time, not add work. How many live prospect calls does each hire need before they\u2019re consistently ready?",
      "llm_ms": 3676,
      "end": false,
      "audio_s": 9.09
    },
    {
      "text": "We compare pilot reps\u2019 time to consistency and first-call quality against your dozen-call baseline; every score cites the quote. How many hires this quarter?",
      "llm_ms": 4087,
      "end": false,
      "audio_s": 10.29
    },
    {
      "text": "Annual pricing is $90 per rep monthly; pilot cost depends on team size. How many of the 15 would you want included?",
      "llm_ms": 5082,
      "end": false,
      "audio_s": 8.89
    },
    {
      "text": "Thirteen reps cost $14,040 annually; all 15 cost $16,200. Could we scope a 30-day pilot Tuesday at 2 with you and enablement?",
      "llm_ms": 7656,
      "end": false,
      "audio_s": 12.19
    },
    {
      "text": "Perfect\u2014I\u2019ll send Tuesday at 2 with you and enablement to scope the 13-rep pilot. Thanks, Dana.",
      "llm_ms": 4460,
      "end": true,
      "audio_s": 7.24
    }
